menu "PaperColor local photo effects"

config PAPERCOLOR_OIL_PAINT
    bool "Enable offline oil-paint effect in the photo viewer"
    default n
    help
        Apply a deterministic RGB565 brush renderer to the currently displayed
        photo on the PaperColor itself. The resulting Canvas is submitted through
        the production M5GFX/ED2208 color conversion. This does not enable the
        retired experimental LUT or photo ditherer.

config PAPERCOLOR_OIL_PAINT_STACKED
    bool "Use accepted stacked-brush renderer"
    depends on PAPERCOLOR_OIL_PAINT
    default y
    help
        Five-pass detail-preserving renderer, with caller-owned PSRAM workspace
        and cooperative scheduling. Disable to retain the legacy oil renderer.

endmenu
